# Release upload keystore - never committed, exactly like android/.gitignore
# for the Capacitor app. The CI workflow decodes it from a GitHub Actions
# secret into keystore.properties at build time; it never exists in the
# working tree otherwise unless a developer drops a real one in locally.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
